WEBVTT

00:00:00.114 --> 00:00:05.761
Recording an expense

00:00:05.811 --> 00:00:08.880
Open Finance, then Expenses.

00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:13.486
Press Add Expense.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:23.363
Enter the amount, category, the account that pays, and a description. The date is today by default.

00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:36.761
Save. The expense is recorded and the account balance updates.

00:00:39.043 --> 00:00:42.942
Use the category filter to review expenses by type.

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:48.581
Expenses are tracked
